      <description><![CDATA[
            <div class="content-box" id="content">
                <style>     div[type]{-webkit-border-radius: 4pt; border-radius: 4pt;overflow:hidden;}     div[type] img{ -webkit-border-radius: 4pt;border-radius: 4pt;}     p{font-family:'苹方','PingFang','\82f95b9','微软雅黑','Microsoft YaHei','XinGothic-SinaWeibo', helvetica, arial, sans-serif;} 	.initFade{ 	    -webkit-transition:opacity 1s; 	    -o-transition:opacity 1s; 	    transition:opacity 1s; 		opacity:0; 	}     .jijin{margin-top: 1.222em !important;padding-bottom: 0.333em;}.jijin_img{display: block;}h3+p{line-height: 12px !important;padding: 4px !important;margin: 0 !important;overflow: visible;}h3+p span{height: 1.72em;line-height: 1.72em;top: 0;}style+p{margin-top: 1.139em;}style+div[type*='GIF'],style+div[type*='IMG']{margin-top: 1.222em !important;}div + div[type*='GIF'], div + div[type*='IMG']{margin-top: 1.778em !important;}div[type*='GIF']{margin: -0.111em auto 0 !important;} div[type*='IMG']{margin: -0.111em auto 0 !important;} body,p{text-align: justify;line-height: 1.72em !important;} p{word-wrap: break-word;overflow:hidden;max-width:100%;word-break: normal !important;margin: 1.44em 0;}.img-info{font-size:0.8333em;line-height:1.53333em!important;text-align:left;color:#999;margin:1.0666em 0 -0.29833em;}   .sub-tlt{position:relative;font-weight: bold;text-indent:0.7777em;}   .sub-tlt:before{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;top:0.86em;width:0.333em;height:0.333em;background:#333;-webkit-transform:translateY(-50%);transform:translateY(-50%)}.img-info + div[type*='GIF'],.img-info + div[type*='IMG']{margin: 1.777em auto 0 !important;}</style><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.8" data="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260504/202605042324082101.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260504/202605042324082101_720.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260504/202605042324082101_720.jpg"> </div><p>【吴宜泽世锦赛加冕】</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/other/2026-05-05/match1975999vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">新王加冕！22岁吴宜泽18-17墨菲世锦赛夺冠 中国第2位世锦赛冠军</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.56" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260505/69f8c494e70a6.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.56" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.56" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260505/69f8c494e70a6.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260505/69f8c494e70a6.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);">2026斯诺克世锦赛决赛，吴宜泽18-17墨菲，夺得本赛季世锦赛冠军！</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/other/2026-05-05/69f8c045d1f5fnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">去年赵心童，今年吴宜泽！中国球员包揽连续两届斯诺克世锦赛冠军</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260505/202605050001091943_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260505/202605050001091943_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260505/202605050001091943_720.jpg"> </div><p>去年赵心童战胜马克-威廉姆斯，夺得冠军，成为首个在该项赛事夺冠的中国人。而今年的世锦赛，同样也由中国选手吴宜泽夺得该赛事冠军！</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/other/2026-05-05/69f8ff62a50cenative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">不敌吴宜泽！肖恩·墨菲21年前世锦赛首冠 之后4进决赛全部失利</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260424/69eb62cca93f4.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260424/69eb62cca93f4.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260424/69eb62cca93f4.jpg"> </div><p>在2005年首冠后，<span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">算上2026年本届赛事，肖恩·墨菲四次进入世锦赛决赛全都输了。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/other/2026-05-05/69f8cc5b5ca0fnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">中国球员世锦赛奖金：吴宜泽冠军拿满50万镑！赵心童8强拿到5万镑</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260416/202604161015124119.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260416/202604161015124119_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260416/202604161015124119_720.jpg"> </div><p>吴宜泽战胜墨菲夺得斯诺克世锦赛冠军！吴宜泽拿满50万镑！</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/other/2026-05-05/69f9145e993cenative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">世锦赛加冕！吴宜泽：我父母才是真正的冠军，是我永远的精神力量</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.88" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260505/202605050550355662.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.88" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.88" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260505/202605050550355662.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260505/202605050550355662.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">斯诺克世锦赛四阶段比赛全部结束，吴宜泽击败肖恩·墨菲，捧得世锦赛冠军！赛后吴宜泽现场采访。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/other/2026-05-05/69f91897af430native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">丁俊晖：祝贺吴宜泽！这不只是突破而是属于我们的时代正在到来！</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/other/2026-05-05/69f9135be7997native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">中国球员连续包揽冠军！赵心童：这是中国斯诺克 恭喜吴宜泽</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.89" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260505/202605050607503793.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.89" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.89" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260505/202605050607503793.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260505/202605050607503793.jpg"> </div><p>吴宜泽夺冠后，丁俊晖、赵心童先后发文祝贺！</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/other/2026-05-05/69f8fe69b6d30native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">火箭来相助！肖国栋：奥沙利文告诉吴宜泽，该怎么解决墨菲的开球</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260430/69f2afba272fb_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260430/69f2afba272fb.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260430/69f2afba272fb.jpg"> </div><p>选手肖国栋此前在决赛期间直播观赛，透露奥沙利文给吴宜泽支招。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/other/2026-05-05/69f8da10cb1a2native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">首夺世锦赛！吴宜泽夺冠之路：胜塞尔比 神奇逆转艾伦 决赛胜墨菲</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260505/69f8da6bb3b4b_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260505/69f8da6bb3b4b_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260505/69f8da6bb3b4b_720.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">本届世锦赛，吴宜泽先后淘汰雷佩凡、塞尔比、瓦菲，半决赛神奇逆转战胜马克·艾伦，决赛战胜墨菲，生涯首次夺得世锦赛冠军。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/other/2026-05-05/69f8c32e423b7native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">打赢你超越你！吴宜泽超越墨菲，成亨德利之后最年轻的世锦赛冠军</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260505/202605050551299426.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260505/202605050551299426.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260505/202605050551299426.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">吴宜泽凭借22岁的年龄，成为亨德利之后最年轻的世锦赛冠军。亨德利在1990年夺得世锦赛冠军时，年仅21岁，目前仍是最年轻的世锦赛冠军。</span></p><p>【比赛战报】</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-05/match1713727date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">少赛1轮落后5分！曼城3-3埃弗顿 格伊致命送礼哈兰德破门多库